    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰξύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>waist</i>, of women, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ δὲ
				ζώνην βάλετ᾽ ἰξυῖ</span> (
				contr.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰξύϊ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.231
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				1.4
			</span></i>; of a man, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				310
			</span></i>; of centaurs, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>; of a deer, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.96
			</span></i>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰξύες, οἱ</span>, <i>loins</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.106
			</span></i>: sg.,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσφύς</span>, [Id.]<i><span class="en">
				14.706
			</span></i>. (Perh. akin to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχύς</span>, cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχίον.</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
				[ῡ</span> in nom. and acc. sg., <i><span class="en">
				Choerob.
				<u>in Theod.</u>
				1.331
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span> in trisyll.
			cases.]</div>
